 that poured out of the otherworldly realm known as the Elysion.\n\nKaoru Tsukimiya, a \"witch hunter\" who hunts demons, travels to the cursed island of Karyūjima in search of revenge, where she encounters her natural enemy, Fiona, the \"immortal witch\"...?\n\nWitch Hunter × Immortal Witch\n\nA pair who are utterly incompatible, the worst possible duo, take on bizarre and supernatural incidents together!\nAn action-packed story of magic and sword dance, starring two people who can never truly get along.\n\n(Translated, from Kadocomi)\n\n---\nOriginal Character Design: [Tōsaka Asagi](https://mangadex.org/author/87f04763-6c02-414d-85bf-41a77ff11978/tosaka-asagi)\nAlt. Official Raw: [NicoNico](https://manga.nicovideo.jp/comic/84006)","year":2026,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Adventure","Girls' Love","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/f89b2d11-e530-400d-a1bb-2601541b040d/9612ccdd-c5ec-433a-a4e3-1c0b71db4d5a.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["pt-br","en","fr"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.57,"follows":4730,"listAt":"2026-10-19T13:06:51.445Z","chapters":[{"id":"6f7a6be0-ca4f-40a3-a4a4-0f49ecf87a1c","number":"5","volume":null,"title":"Crimson Dragon Restaurant","lang":"en","pages":28,"createdAt":"2026-09-27T04:38:06+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"55c5278e-35ca-4200-9334-586517f5958d","number":"4","volume":null,"title":"Dreams","lang":"en","pages":25,"createdAt":"2026-08-28T15:33:59+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"d502a648-4505-41dc-83b9-d250b697d0bc","number":"3","volume":null,"title":"The First Job","lang":"en","pages":40,"createdAt":"2026-07-30T09:33:09+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"dea91aa3-9046-4f2e-a364-8f76b24aad15","number":"2","volume":null,"title":"Nekoyūkan","lang":"en","pages":27,"createdAt":"2026-07-28T08:36:35+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"80a86a73-3ba0-49ef-94eb-fdd19c0ffebe","number":"1","volume":null,"title":"The Gravity of Arch-Enemies","lang":"en","pages":45,"createdAt